# EPD105 sunxi-keyboard: reader page keys, selected by input device name.
#
# MEASURED 2026-09-18 -- no single forward-page key suits all three readers:
#   key         Kindle   KOReader   EinkBro
#   SPACE       yes      NO         yes
#   DPAD_RIGHT  yes      yes        NO
#   PAGE_DOWN   NO       yes        yes
# DPAD_RIGHT is chosen so both readers page from the hardware key; EinkBro pages
# by tap/swipe instead. DPAD_LEFT goes back in Kindle and KOReader both.
key 115   DPAD_LEFT         # Vol Up   = previous page (Kindle, KOReader)
key 114   DPAD_RIGHT        # Vol Down = next page (Kindle, KOReader)
key 28    ENTER
key 102   HOME
key 139   MENU
